  "sil_after": [
   465.749229,
   466.102585
  ],
  "i": 73,
  "text": "Is that a lot of you folks come here searching for Tao and you watch my videos, but you don't subscribe!"
 },
 {
  "start": 466.102585,
  "end": 470.173696,
  "sil_before": [
   465.749229,
   466.102585
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   470.173696,
   470.799637
  ],
  "i": 74,
  "text": "So click that subscribe button and click that like button too if you like this content."
 },
 {
  "start": 470.799637,
  "end": 471.860113,
  "sil_before": [
   470.173696,
   470.799637
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   471.860113,
   482.689456
  ],
  "i": 75,
  "text": "but let's dive into it."
 },
 {
  "start": 482.689456,
  "end": 484.766236,
  "sil_before": [
   471.860113,
   482.689456
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   484.766236,
   485.384195
  ],
  "i": 76,
  "text": "But Tenzer is not one AI product."
 },
 {
  "start": 485.384195,
  "end": 487.329297,
  "sil_before": [
   484.766236,
   485.384195
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   487.329297,
   499.080658
  ],
  "i": 77,
  "text": "It's a marketplace of markets."
 },
 {
  "start": 499.080658,
  "end": 501.558367,
  "sil_before": [
   487.329297,
   499.080658
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   501.558367,
   504.832925
  ],
  "i": 78,
  "text": "The chain underneath is called subtensor."
 },
 {
  "start": 504.832925,
  "end": 507.306621,
  "sil_before": [
   501.558367,
   504.832925
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   507.306621,
   507.764218
  ],
  "i": 79,
  "text": "And living on top of that chain are the subnets."
 },
 {
  "start": 507.764218,
  "end": 509.151678,
  "sil_before": [
   507.306621,
   507.764218
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   509.151678,
   512.870295
  ],
  "i": 80,
  "text": "over 120 of them."
 },
 {
  "start": 512.870295,
  "end": 517.381202,
  "sil_before": [
   509.151678,
   512.870295
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   517.381202,
   519.617528
  ],
  "i": 81,
  "text": "Each subnet is its own competitive market for one specific kind of AI work."
 },
 {
  "start": 519.617528,
  "end": 522.45966,
  "sil_before": [
   517.381202,
   519.617528
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   522.45966,
   523.350045
  ],
  "i": 82,
  "text": "Think One Subnet for raw GPU compute."
 },
 {
  "start": 523.350045,
  "end": 525.925488,
  "sil_before": [
   522.45966,
   523.350045
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   525.925488,
   526.384989
  ],
  "i": 83,
  "text": "One for text generation, one for images."
 },
 {
  "start": 526.384989,
  "end": 528.972744,
  "sil_before": [
   525.925488,
   526.384989
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   528.972744,
   543.551542
  ],
  "i": 84,
  "text": "one for trading signals, and so on, and so on."
 },
 {
  "start": 543.551542,
  "end": 545.556916,
  "sil_before": [
   528.972744,
   543.551542
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   545.556916,
   545.998776
  ],
  "i": 85,
  "text": "Now zoom into any single subnet."
 },
 {
  "start": 545.998776,
  "end": 547.789048,
  "sil_before": [
   545.556916,
   545.998776
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   547.789048,
   548.77966
  ],
  "i": 86,
  "text": "and you'll find four jobs inside."
 },
 {
  "start": 548.77966,
  "end": 552.25619,
  "sil_before": [
   547.789048,
   548.77966
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   552.25619,
   557.126463
  ],
  "i": 87,
  "text": "The subnet owner defines the task, what this market pays for."
 },
 {
  "start": 557.126463,
  "end": 561.051383,
  "sil_before": [
   552.25619,
   557.126463
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   561.051383,
   565.558707
  ],
  "i": 88,
  "text": "And for that, owners earn 18% of the subnet's emissions."
 },
 {
  "start": 565.558707,
  "end": 571.035646,
  "sil_before": [
   561.051383,
   565.558707
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   571.035646,
   573.035918
  ],
  "i": 89,
  "text": "Emissions, in plain English, is the new tile the network prints every day as rewards."
 },
 {
  "start": 573.035918,
  "end": 574.809161,
  "sil_before": [
   571.035646,
   573.035918
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   574.809161,
   575.452971
  ],
  "i": 90,
  "text": "The miners do the actual work."
 },
 {
  "start": 575.452971,
  "end": 577.748413,
  "sil_before": [
   574.809161,
   575.452971
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   577.748413,
   578.336757
  ],
  "i": 91,
  "text": "They run the models. They serve the compute."
 },
 {
  "start": 578.336757,
  "end": 580.411837,
  "sil_before": [
   577.748413,
   578.336757
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   580.411837,
   583.563764
  ],
  "i": 92,
  "text": "and as a group they earn 41%."
 },
 {
  "start": 583.563764,
  "end": 586.479002,
  "sil_before": [
   580.411837,
   583.563764
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   586.479002,
   587.097823
  ],
  "i": 93,
  "text": "The validators test the miners and score their work."
 },
 {
  "start": 587.097823,
  "end": 589.658118,
  "sil_before": [
   586.479002,
   587.097823
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   589.658118,
   590.06746
  ],
  "i": 94,
  "text": "and he also earned 41% because"
 },
 {
  "start": 590.06746,
  "end": 593.461202,
  "sil_before": [
   589.658118,
   590.06746
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   593.461202,
   596.506871
  ],
  "i": 95,
  "text": "Honest grading is worth exactly as much as the work itself."
 },
 {
  "start": 596.506871,
  "end": 597.600091,
  "sil_before": [
   593.461202,
   596.506871
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   597.600091,
   598.280522
  ],
  "i": 96,
  "text": "and the Delegators."
 },
 {
  "start": 598.280522,
  "end": 600.595578,
  "sil_before": [
   597.600091,
   598.280522
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   600.595578,
   601.219252
  ],
  "i": 97,
  "text": "that's regular towel holders like you and me."
 },
 {
  "start": 601.219252,
  "end": 603.303537,
  "sil_before": [
   600.595578,
   601.219252
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   603.303537,
   604.211293
  ],
  "i": 98,
  "text": "stake behind validators they trust."
 },
 {
  "start": 604.211293,
  "end": 606.417868,
  "sil_before": [
   603.303537,
   604.211293
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   606.417868,
   619.895918
  ],
  "i": 99,
  "text": "and share in what those validators earn."
 },
 {
  "start": 619.895918,
  "end": 624.938027,
  "sil_before": [
   606.417868,
   619.895918
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   624.938027,
   625.662993
  ],
  "i": 100,
  "text": "So what keeps the grading honest? That's a Yuma consensus, and it's the heart of the whole thing."
 },
 {
  "start": 625.662993,
  "end": 629.532676,
  "sil_before": [
   624.938027,
   625.662993
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   629.532676,
   635.373719
  ],
  "i": 101,
  "text": "Every validator submits scores on the minors. They're called weights."
 },
 {
  "start": 635.373719,
  "end": 637.51322,
  "sil_before": [
   629.532676,
   635.373719
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   637.51322,
   638.04932
  ],
  "i": 102,
  "text": "The chain takes all those scores."
 },
 {
  "start": 638.04932,
  "end": 639.348073,
  "sil_before": [
   637.51322,
   638.04932
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   639.348073,
   639.887347
  ],
  "i": 103,
  "text": "ways than by stake."
 },
 {
  "start": 639.887347,
  "end": 642.319773,
  "sil_before": [
   639.348073,
   639.887347
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   642.319773,
   652.092585
  ],
  "i": 104,
  "text": "and pays out emissions based on the agreement."
 },
 {
  "start": 652.092585,
  "end": 657.449184,
  "sil_before": [
   642.319773,
   652.092585
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   657.449184,
   658.758662
  ],
  "i": 105,
  "text": "And if one validator tries to pump their buddy's score way above what everybody else reported"
 },
 {
  "start": 658.758662,
  "end": 660.193968,
  "sil_before": [
   657.449184,
   658.758662
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   660.193968,
   661.928526
  ],
  "i": 106,
  "text": "The consensus clips it."
 },
 {
  "start": 661.928526,
  "end": 666.496032,
  "sil_before": [
   660.193968,
   661.928526
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   666.496032,
   667.935986
  ],
  "i": 107,
  "text": "That inflated weight gets put back down toward the crowd number automatically."
 },
 {
  "start": 667.935986,
  "end": 669.183696,
  "sil_before": [
   666.496032,
   667.935986
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   669.183696,
   678.41737
  ],
  "i": 108,
  "text": "Collusion just doesn't pay."
 },
 {
  "start": 678.41737,
  "end": 682.186508,
  "sil_before": [
   669.183696,
   678.41737
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   682.186508,
   685.0761
  ],
  "i": 109,
  "text": "The network grades its own homework and it's rigged against liars."
 },
 {
  "start": 685.0761,
  "end": 686.371655,
  "sil_before": [
   682.186508,
   685.0761
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   686.371655,
   688.354444
  ],
  "i": 110,
  "text": "That's the security model."
 },
 {
  "start": 688.354444,
  "end": 690.427324,
  "sil_before": [
   686.371655,
   688.354444
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   690.427324,
   694.559025
  ],
  "i": 111,
  "text": "Now here's the upgrade that changed everything."
 },
 {
  "start": 694.559025,
  "end": 698.207755,
  "sil_before": [
   690.427324,
   694.559025
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   698.207755,
   698.720408
  ],
  "i": 112,
  "text": "On February 13th, 2025, Matenza shipped"
 },
 {
  "start": 698.720408,
  "end": 699.755442,
  "sil_before": [
   698.207755,
   698.720408
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   699.755442,
   700.149773
  ],
  "i": 113,
  "text": "Dynamic Tao."
 },
 {
  "start": 700.149773,
  "end": 700.891406,
  "sil_before": [
   699.755442,
   700.149773
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   700.891406,
   702.264535
  ],
  "i": 114,
  "text": "or D-Towel."
 },
 {
  "start": 702.264535,
  "end": 707.531837,
  "sil_before": [
   700.891406,
   702.264535
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   707.531837,
   707.841247
  ],
  "i": 115,
  "text": "And before this upgrade, a small club of about 64 root validators"
 },
 {
  "start": 707.841247,
  "end": 710.940975,
  "sil_before": [
   707.531837,
   707.841247
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   710.940975,
   711.424989
  ],
  "i": 116,
  "text": "basically voted on which subnets received the emissions."
 },
 {
  "start": 711.424989,
  "end": 712.002902,
  "sil_before": [
   710.940975,
   711.424989
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   712.002902,
   713.017868
  ],
  "i": 117,
  "text": "committee."
 },
 {
  "start": 713.017868,
  "end": 714.657052,
  "sil_before": [
   712.002902,
   713.017868
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   714.657052,
   715.160635
  ],
  "i": 118,
  "text": "DETAL fired that committee."
 },
 {
  "start": 715.160635,
  "end": 717.047256,
  "sil_before": [
   714.657052,
   715.160635
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   717.047256,
   717.86712
  ],
  "i": 119,
  "text": "and handed that decision to the market."
 },
 {
  "start": 717.86712,
  "end": 721.177868,
  "sil_before": [
   717.047256,
   717.86712
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   721.177868,
   723.143311
  ],
  "i": 120,
  "text": "Now every subnet has its own token, colon alpha token."
 },
 {
  "start": 723.143311,
  "end": 725.384875,
  "sil_before": [
   721.177868,
   723.143311
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   725.384875,
   725.884694
  ],
  "i": 121,
  "text": "also hard capped at 21 million."
 },
 {
  "start": 725.884694,
  "end": 727.32102,
  "sil_before": [
   725.384875,
   725.884694
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   727.32102,
   728.591224
  ],
  "i": 122,
  "text": "mirroring Tile's having."
 },
 {
  "start": 728.591224,
  "end": 731.141995,
  "sil_before": [
   727.32102,
   728.591224
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   731.141995,
   735.634172
  ],
  "i": 123,
  "text": "you stake tau into that subnet's training pool."
 },
 {
  "start": 735.634172,
  "end": 739.294399,
  "sil_before": [
   731.141995,
   735.634172
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   739.294399,
   746.478753
  ],
  "i": 124,
  "text": "And demand for its alpha is what sets the subnet slice of emission."
 },
 {
  "start": 746.478753,
  "end": 750.102585,
  "sil_before": [
   739.294399,
   746.478753
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   750.102585,
   750.993469
  ],
  "i": 125,
  "text": "So money flows towards the subnets people actually believe in."
 },
 {
  "start": 750.993469,
  "end": 753.003991,
  "sil_before": [
   750.102585,
   750.993469
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   753.003991,
   756.572086
  ],
  "i": 126,
  "text": "and drains away from the ones they don't."
 },
 {
  "start": 756.572086,
  "end": 758.57737,
  "sil_before": [
   753.003991,
   756.572086
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   758.57737,
   759.245805
  ],
  "i": 127,
  "text": "It's a live continuous vote."
 },
 {
  "start": 759.245805,
  "end": 760.300499,
  "sil_before": [
   758.57737,
   759.245805
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   760.300499,
   763.543333
  ],
  "i": 128,
  "text": "priced in town."
 },
 {
  "start": 763.543333,
  "end": 764.572041,
  "sil_before": [
   760.300499,
   763.543333
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   764.572041,
   766.237166
  ],
  "i": 129,
  "text": "So add it all up."
 },
 {
  "start": 766.237166,
  "end": 768.026145,
  "sil_before": [
   764.572041,
   766.237166
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   768.026145,
   768.650159
  ],
  "i": 130,
  "text": "Over 120 markets."
 },
 {
  "start": 768.650159,
  "end": 771.117937,
  "sil_before": [
   768.026145,
   768.650159
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   771.117937,
   771.761293
  ],
  "i": 131,
  "text": "Every one of them are competing AI business."
 },
 {
  "start": 771.761293,
  "end": 773.436553,
  "sil_before": [
   771.117937,
   771.761293
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   773.436553,
   774.156689
  ],
  "i": 132,
  "text": "One chain coordinating them."
 },
 {
  "start": 774.156689,
  "end": 775.859728,
  "sil_before": [
   773.436553,
   774.156689
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   775.859728,
   783.771973
  ],
  "i": 133,
  "text": "one token pricing all of it."
 },
 {
  "start": 783.771973,
  "end": 788.073628,
  "sil_before": [
   775.859728,
   783.771973
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   788.073628,
   794.425624
  ],
  "i": 134,
  "text": "Anyone on earth could just plug a brand new market into it without asking for permission."
 },
 {
  "start": 794.425624,
  "end": 798.81898,
  "sil_before": [
   788.073628,
   794.425624
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   798.81898,
   804.339229
  ],
  "i": 135,
  "text": "So hold that picture in your head because now we meet the competition."
 }
]